</div>
</div>
 </div> <div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1705745694667"><strong class="schema-faq-question">Q. How many NBA Finals have the Chicago Bulls lost?</strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">The Chicago Bulls did not lose any NBA Finals in their franchise history.</p> </div> <div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1705745758735"><strong class="schema-faq-question">Q. How many Finals have the Toronto Raptors won?</strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">The Toronto Raptors won their only Championship Finals in 2019.</p> </div> </div>



